{
  "id": "rakel",
  "name": "Rachel",
  "title": "Jacob's Beloved",
  "era": "patriarchs",
  "lifespan": "c. 1800–1750 BC",
  "summary": "Rachel was Jacob's great love, the daughter of Laban. Jacob worked for 14 years to have her as his wife. She was the mother of Joseph and Benjamin, but died during Benjamin's birth. Her beauty and Jacob's deep love for her run like a red thread through the patriarchal history.",
